  "body": "Hi all.\r\n\r\nI've sucessfully setup a server, but have since used it only for testing purposes. This means that there's a good few rooms that I'm unable to remove as well as plenty of users that it seems difficult to delete. Therefore, what is the best/easiest way to 'reset' my server, so that I can start fresh? Is it just a case of uninstalling it and reinstalling? I'm on Ubuntu and I'd like to save my settings (homeserver.yaml I beleive has everything in it), since it took me long enough to get it all working, so it's more a case of removing all rooms / users.\r\n\r\nAny help is much appreciated.",
